# Agent scope (Core2)

Agents in this workspace must stay scoped to THIS repo and THIS Linear project for any **write** operation.

## Allowed (read)

- Documentation lookups across any project.
- Searching memory across federated projects to inform decisions.
- Browsing sibling repositories for reference only.

## Forbidden (write outside Core2)

- Creating, updating, commenting on, or moving Linear issues that belong to a different project than **Core2**.
- Modifying files, branches, or pull requests in any other repository.
- Pushing, merging, releasing, or running automation for another project.

## How to apply

- Read team / project / repo identity from `.tapps-mcp.yaml` or the current git remote.
- When in doubt whether a target belongs to this project, stop and ask the user instead of writing.
